se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThere are 20 kinds of fruits in a fruit shop. The shop owner tells the customers that he thinks most of them are domestically produced, a small part is imported from Thailand, and there are almost no fruits imported from Australia. After checking, the customer finds that only 4 kinds are imported from Thailand.\n\n[Question]\nBefore the customer checks, how many domestically produced fruits does he guess?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before checking, the customer guesses there is 1 kind of domestically produced fruit.\nB. Before checking, the customer guesses there are 5 kinds of domestically produced fruits.\nC. Before checking, the customer guesses there are 10 kinds of domestically produced fruits.\nD. Before checking, the customer guesses there are 15 kinds of domestically produced fruits.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001169491033911901,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e25dd6006945d2802421","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368093358,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"391a2552133b4424a3c885eee8903e64"}